// codebox_hold.gen -- f_vf_lbm: the loop break and one-frame delay of the state atlas (the f_vf_fluid / f_ks
// hold idiom). An identity pass over the 192x324 state atlas.
//
// Inlets (outer order): first = the frame gate's bang (hot; unused in the code, it only triggers the render on every
// Nth frame), second = the state atlas from the stream stage (cold). The collide stage is triggered by this stage's
// output, so the whole loop advances once per gated frame and the feedback never retriggers itself. Not benched on
// its own (an identity); the live module bench covers it.
out1 = nearest(in2, norm);
